message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "UEQ-mLLM: Agentic LLM Workflows for Personalized User Experience Questionnaire Generation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of UEQ-mLLM, a four-agent LLM workflow that turns
  real-time emotion and attention signals from the MIND multimodal dashboard
  into personalized user experience questionnaires organized by the UX
  honeycomb model.
